                <note rend="inline" type="source">264.11/5: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Hungary</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Brentano</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Budapest</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-05-29T13:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 29, 1922—1
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received May 30—9:10 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>29. Your 24 May 19, 3 p.m. Note relative to treaties dated and delivered May
                    27th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Brentano</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
